From ba2bf4eef0e86807f377d12b593f1404f6e458d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:52:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 29/42] tests: the bond store and the device cache of
 bluetooth_server

24 tests, run with UnitTester: bonds kept across a reload and per
adapter, no key in the file of the bonds, the keys file only for its
owner, debug keys and pairings without a bond for the connection only,
changed combination keys, the rules on forgetting a key for each status
and side, the security of each kind of key, the listener, broken and
half-written files, bonds without a key, fields of a later version, and
the pruning of the device cache.

All pass on ARM (AC100). Built for x86_64, not run there yet; the store
itself also compiles with gcc2 and -Werror.

Signed-off-by: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
